auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  # Experience Bookings API

  Run the requests in order (1 to 4). Each one stores the id returned by the
  server into a runtime variable, so the whole flow works without editing
  anything:

  1. Register Experience  -> stores experience_id
  2. Create Session       -> stores session_id (starts 10 days from now)
  3. Book Seats           -> stores booking_id
  4. Cancel Booking       -> cancels booking_id

  Select the "Local" environment first (base_url = http://localhost:8080).
}
